Cleanup

- [ ] Image converter
  - [ ] The image converter does not resize the preview to the aspect ratio of the image correctly
    - [ ] I tested this with `photo-1780071611689-55d7b5ace40a.avif` and saw it being broken
    - [ ] adapt the preview pane size or if not possible use `object-fit: contain;`
- [ ] Image compressor
  - [ ] The image compressor should support a target percentage or filesize (with a notice saying it may not be possible)
- [ ] Image editor
  - [ ] should support either upload to start (current) or starting from an empty canvas (set resolution)
    - [ ] First uploaded image should be the base layer, and set the initial canvas size
  - [ ] Canvas should be re-sizeable
  - [ ] Should support image-based layers
  - [ ] Tools should operate per-layer (e.g. I should be able to crop an image layer that does not crop the whole canvas)
    - [ ] Should become sub-layers (e.g. an eraser layer only effeects the layer it's directly under in the heirarchy)
      - [ ] Should be draggable under other layers, and deleteable
      - [ ] If an eraser layer or crop is dragged to top layer it should effect layers below it
  - [ ] Layers should have settings
      - [ ] Opacity
      - [ ] Blend modes
        - [ ] Soft light
        - [ ] Hard light
        - [ ] color
        - [ ] multiply
        - [ ] Overlay; Combines Multiply and Screen for contrast enhancement.
  - [ ] Should be able to set the image name and format when downloading


